{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/extras/Bony_Odyssey_\u0431\u0435\u043b-\u0436\u0435\u043b_1.png?t=1746726257\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fast-paced 2D platformer packed with action and endless challenges!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/extras/ezgif-37cc87f69e397b.gif?t=1746726257\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Skeleton, and your favorite animals have mysteriously disappeared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, hit weird creatures, slide down ropes, and race through a world full of traps, chaos, and sudden surprises.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/extras/ezgif-88987bd08197b1.gif?t=1746726257\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash enemies, dodge deadly hazards, and don\u2019t stop moving \u2014 every second counts in this fast-paced, hand-crafted platformer.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/extras/BossGif.gif?t=1746726257\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bony Odyssey is a wild journey packed with unexpected twists, silly moments, and satisfying action. Just don\u2019t fall into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready for an adventure that never slows down?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/extras/64SkeletonSkullAvatar.png?t=1746726257\" /><br>Don't miss such fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add to wishlist!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1858790?t=1746726257","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/4184ffc6bd634b9fa4bd4522c5dd0b03e4974396/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746726257","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/dcce190d5f731d027f006fcd7dbaadad84385319/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746726257","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/dcce190d5f731d027f006fcd7dbaadad84385319/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746726257","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3629310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/extras/Bony_Odyssey_\u0431\u0435\u043b-\u0436\u0435\u043b_1.png?t=1746726257\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fast-paced 2D platformer packed with action and endless challenges!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/extras/ezgif-37cc87f69e397b.gif?t=1746726257\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Skeleton, and your favorite animals have mysteriously disappeared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, hit weird creatures, slide down ropes, and race through a world full of traps, chaos, and sudden surprises.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/extras/ezgif-88987bd08197b1.gif?t=1746726257\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash enemies, dodge deadly hazards, and don\u2019t stop moving \u2014 every second counts in this fast-paced, hand-crafted platformer.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/extras/BossGif.gif?t=1746726257\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bony Odyssey is a wild journey packed with unexpected twists, silly moments, and satisfying action. Just don\u2019t fall into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready for an adventure that never slows down?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/extras/64SkeletonSkullAvatar.png?t=1746726257\" /><br>Don't miss such fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add to wishlist!</p>","developers":["Anatoly Konstantinov"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858790/aa4becf1ce7af37c155956b9cdd6da0611e39cd6/header.jpg?t=1746726257","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108415,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108415/movie480.mp4?t=1741012342","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108415/movie_max.mp4?t=1741012342"},"name":"Open Playtest","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108415/a0594e0bcb937c54c688785e2f64b1349e8cf89a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741012342","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108415/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741012342","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108415/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741012342"}}],"name":"Bony Odyssey","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeF